# Regenerate: vhs docs/assets/gifs/cli-doctor.tape
Output docs/assets/gifs/cli-doctor.gif

Require bash
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.25
Set MarginFill "#0d1117"

Type "flutter-mcp-toolkit --help"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Type "flutter-mcp-toolkit doctor"
Enter
Sleep 4.5s